---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Privacy policy - Naturide" pageType="privacy">
  <section class="bg-sand-50 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-forest-900 sm:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-forest-800/70">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US')}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-forest mt-8 max-w-none space-y-6 text-forest-800/90">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">1. Data controller</h2>
          <p>
            The data controller is the owner of the Naturide project, contact:
            <a href="mailto:mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com" class="text-forest-700 underline">mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">2. What data we collect</h2>
          <p>Through Naturide.app we may collect:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Email address - if you subscribe to the launch notification.</li>
            <li>Technical data (IP address, browser type, operating system) - for statistics and security.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">3. Purpose of processing</h2>
          <p>We process data only to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Send a notification when the Naturide app launches.</li>
            <li>Reply to questions sent by email.</li>
            <li>Analyze site traffic (anonymized data).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">4. Legal basis</h2>
          <p>The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR (consent) for the notification subscription, and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest) for technical data needed to operate the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">5. Retention</h2>
          <p>We keep your email until the app launches or until you withdraw consent (removals are processed within 7 business days). Technical data is kept only as long as needed for security purposes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">6. Your rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>access your data,</li>
            <li>rectify your data,</li>
            <li>erase your data (right to be forgotten),</li>
            <li>restrict processing,</li>
            <li>data portability,</li>
            <li>object to processing,</li>
            <li>lodge a complaint with your data protection authority.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com" class="text-forest-700 underline">mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com</a> or use the <a href="/en/remove-data/" class="text-forest-700 underline">data removal form</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">7. Cookies</h2>
          <p>The site may use cookies for analytics (e.g. anonymized visit statistics). You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">8. Changes</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to update this policy. Material changes will be announced on the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900">9. Data processor</h2>
          <p>
            The launch notification form is processed by Netlify (Netlify, Inc., USA) under a
            data processing agreement. Netlify stores form submissions on its servers.
            The current list of Netlify subprocessors is available at
            <a href="https://www.netlify.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest-700 underline">netlify.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
